NOTICE REGARDING ORIGINAL GAME ASSETS AND SOURCE CODE

The original Phantom Fighter game was developed by Billy Newport at Emerald
Software (Ireland) in 1988 and published by Martech Software (UK) and
Broderbund Software (USA).

The original 68000 assembler/C source code and game assets (graphics, sounds,
level data) contained in this repository were created during that period.
Copyright in those works was held by Emerald Software. To the best of the
author's knowledge, Emerald Software and its publishers (Martech Software,
Broderbund Software) are no longer operating as active entities, and no party
has commercially exploited or asserted rights over this title in decades.

This material is shared in good faith for historical, educational, and
preservation purposes by the original author/programmer. If any party believes
they hold a legitimate claim to rights in this work, please open an issue on
this repository and the matter will be addressed promptly.

The Python recreation (python/ directory) and associated tooling are new works
by Billy Newport and are licensed under the MIT License above.
